      "message": "This makes it sound as though Skia is **requiring** this feature be enabled such that we can use it (so long as the extension is present). Is that intentional?\n\nIf no, then perhaps change the verbiage to something like \n`In order to use dynamic vertex input state, we must check the physical device for feature support. To enable using it, an instance of VkPhysicalDeviceVertexInputDynamicStateFeaturesEXT with vertexInputDynamicState set to VK_TRUE must be passed in during device creation.`",
